lavapipe: keep immutable samplers in push descriptor sets

 .../frontends/lavapipe/lvp_descriptor_set.c        | 41 ++++++++++++++--------
 src/gallium/frontends/lavapipe/lvp_execute.c       | 13 +++++--
 src/gallium/frontends/lavapipe/lvp_private.h       |  3 ++
 3 files changed, 41 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)
